OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: Saved cameras connect over your Wi-Fi or hotspot. Long-press the picture for AE lock; AWB lock sits in WB. Redesigned Multiview with a settings panel and new Wi-Fi setup. Double-tap to track, joystick sizes, glass pills. Shutter angle holds when FPS changes. Adds LEVEL, experimental Action 6, lower CPU use. Fixes Media libraries, Live View crashes, video freezes, Nano zoom, clip deletion, portrait Recenter. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
